      {
        "path": "OpenSOVD/patches/inc_diagnostics/0004-feat-sovd_adapter-serve-diag_api-DataResources-as-an.patch",
        "registry_path_exists": false,
        "sha256": "23b0318df8a18b28d7a9ac97c5a58f42c31ba6fc077d562c0588355cdb4469c1",
        "sha_matches": null,
        "mail_header": "From 4342d577970bddcf5879d9a4de119275719addb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nFrom: Purushotham Erupuri <erupuripurushotham1@gmail.com>\nDate: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:43:48 +0200\nSubject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(sovd_adapter): serve diag_api DataResources as an\n opensovd DataProvider\n\nDataResourceRegistry keeps each resource next to its metadata; SovdDataProvider\nimplements opensovd_core::DataProvider over it:\n\n- list/categories/groups from DataResourceMetadata, with category/group/tag filters\n- read/write await ReadValueHandle/WriteValueHandle (ready, future, closure)\n- resources sit behind a Mutex (write takes &mut self); the lock is never held\n  across an await\n- per-resource PayloadFormat so the binary-only uds adapters are served as hex\n  without extra code\n- diag_api errors and NRCs map to DataError; read-only writes are rejected\n\nRefs #16\n\n---\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/BUILD       |  54 +++++\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/convert.rs  | 260 ++++++++++++++++++++\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/handle.rs   |  95 ++++++++\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/lib.rs      |  36 +++\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/provider.rs | 321 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\n score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/registry.rs | 203 ++++++++++++++++\n 6 files changed, 969 insertions(+)\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/BUILD\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/convert.rs\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/handle.rs\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/lib.rs\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/provider.rs\n create mode 100644 score/mw/diag/sovd_adapter/registry.rs\n\n",
