        "sha256": "b9f09bae291784836b544c68d0be09edd6e82f48df89c47a79b5476e9307a581",
        "sha_matches": true,
        "mail_header": "From 84075c096b835c82af1c40e0b2328fba11bc8438 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nFrom: jnsagai <jnsagai@gmail.com>\nDate: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:54:16 +0100\nSubject: [PATCH] Rust::com: Support typed FindServiceSpecifier::Any discovery\n\nAddresses #250.\n\nReplace the panic for FindServiceSpecifier::Any with typed, same-interface\nAny discovery in the LoLa runtime. Interfaces register their LoLa wildcard\nconfiguration; find_service and the async discovery path resolve Any\nthrough native find-any (FFI find_service_any / start_find_service_any)\nand return ServiceNotFound for unmapped, concrete or malformed\nregistrations. The async search stop guard is created synchronously after\na successful start, so a never-polled or cancelled future stops the native\nsearch.\n\nAdds LoLa unit tests and the consumer_any_apis ITF integration test.\n\nThis is typed same-interface discovery, not system-wide discovery of all\ninterfaces (see #1261).\n\nImplemented with DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n---\n .../com-api/com-api-ffi-lola/bridge_ffi.rs    |  18 +\n .../com-api-ffi-lola/bridge_ffi_lola.rs       |  58 +++\n .../com-api-ffi-lola/bridge_ffi_mock.rs       |  16 +\n .../registry_bridge_macro.cpp                 | 138 ++++++\n .../com-api-ffi-lola/registry_bridge_macro.h  |  63 +++\n .../com-api/com-api-runtime-lola/consumer.rs  | 315 +++++++++++---\n .../com-api/com-api-runtime-lola/runtime.rs   |  13 +-\n score/mw/com/rust/score_com.rs                |   9 +-\n .../mw/com/rust/score_com_concept/concept.rs  |  37 +-\n .../basic_rust_api/bigdata_com_api_gen.cpp    |  39 +-\n .../basic_rust_api/bigdata_com_api_gen.rs     |   8 +\n .../basic_rust_api/consumer_any_apis/BUILD    |  57 +++\n .../consumer_any_apis/consumer_app.rs         | 403 ++++++++++++++++++\n .../consumer_any_apis/integration_test/BUILD  |  22 +\n .../integration_test/com_api_any_api_test.py  |  56 +++\n score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/etc/BUILD    |   5 +-\n .../com/test/basic_rust_api/etc/config.json   |  42 ++\n .../basic_rust_api/etc/provider_config.json   | 228 ++++++++++\n .../producer_app/producer_app.rs              |  83 +++-\n 19 files changed, 1544 insertions(+), 66 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/consumer_any_apis/BUILD\n create mode 100644 score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/consumer_any_apis/consumer_app.rs\n create mode 100644 score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/consumer_any_apis/integration_test/BUILD\n create mode 100644 score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/consumer_any_apis/integration_test/com_api_any_api_test.py\n create mode 100644 score/mw/com/test/basic_rust_api/etc/provider_config.json\n\n",
